      "created_at": "2012-12-29T01:56:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yup. I do exactly what Koga said. I sleeve my cards too so I just glue the two sides together and it's usually thick enough. I use semi-gloss paper to mimic the card surface as closely as possible.&nbsp;</p><p>I recently got an original Young Legacy from a charity and since that one is from the First Edition print run it is a bit thinner than all subsequent cards, so I actually still use my printed copy in games.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
