      "id": 50816,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-29T06:14:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Not helpful, McBehrer…  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/rage.png?v=9\" title=\":rage:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rage:\">  Some people haven't been lucky enough to get their hands on the harder-to-find promos - no need to rub it in.</p>\n<p>If it helps, because the promo cards are character cards, you really don't have to worry about how it looks, as you won't be shuffling it or anything. You can just print it on anything you want. For the new cards that are coming with Shattered Timelines, that's what I've done - I just printed the images provided on cardstock and dropped them in the box with the other character cards. When we want to use the alternate character, we just pull it out and use it.</p>",
